#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:5
#: a7f60a718de546c39a1927a54ddab246
msgid "Pixhawk 6C 6C Mini Flight Controller"
msgstr "Pixhawk 6C/6C Mini 飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:7
#: a7c3f41dd977412e9f9806778c6dae7d
msgid ""
"Pixhawk6C is the latest update to the successful family of Pixhawk® "
"autopilots made by Holybro, featuring STM32H7 cpus, vibration isolation of "
"IMUs, redundant IMUs, and IMU heating. It comes in two form factors. The 6C "
"Mini reduces the size and has a built-in PWM motor/servo header, at the "
"expense of a bit fewer ports."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk6C 是 Holybro 生产的 Pixhawk® 飞控系列的最新版本，搭载 STM32H7 处理器，具备 IMU 隔振、冗余 IMU 和"
" IMU 加热功能，提供两种外形规格。6C Mini 缩小了尺寸并内置 PWM 电机/舵机接头，但端口数量略少。"

