#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:42
#: 346868a5b04a4c4c8ef65ee1af1fe9cd
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:43
#: 3abd3b17bd9147518342be74780bc7a2
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which"
" require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的"
" UART 连接）。但 FPort 以此方式连接时，仅提供 RC 而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:45
#: 0bcca20f66c348568cb6acf1d8628629
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL5 (UART3) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6. For the 6C Mini, "
"SERIAL1 - SERIAL4 would need to be used."
msgstr ""
"为支持 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的嵌入式数传，需使用完整 UART（如 SERIAL5（UART3））进行接收机连接。以下为使用 "
"Serial6 的设置。对于 6C Mini，需使用 SERIAL1 至 SERIAL4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:47
#: 65a2bfb0ac874c54aad2e3693f221fd0
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:49
#: 01a973e021da4219b95dbfcda3713103
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:51
#: 371977f63fa04ecbbf67649c5d6e74eb
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:53
#: 30dd4f3612f049399a2c573c0121a702
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，并仅连接 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:55
#: 05bd2d7e7e57473aa37367eb8412ba60
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:58
#: 24eb6a0802b74f39bcc1ad1a0d9b5e46
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:60
#: 3a56dff724d04e81b04cfe2cd5c35e8b
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk6C supports up to 16 PWM outputs. All 16 outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats. All FMU outputs (marked \"FMU PWM Output\") also "
"support DShot."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk6C 最多支持 16 路 PWM 输出。所有 16 路输出均支持普通 PWM 输出格式。所有 FMU 输出（标注为 「FMU PWM "
"Output」）均支持 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:63
#: e1bb3f2168f546e68bff0605316963ef
msgid "The 8 FMU PWM outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "8 路 FMU PWM 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:65
#: ca8adaab960c41ed90f844cc6b806b2a
msgid "PWM 1, 2, 3 and 4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2、3 和 4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:66
#: 5612e1843b1d4dc0beb0cb443019ea8a
msgid "PWM 5 and 6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5 和 6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:67
#: 4732631d8bcd49a79f13694c6ddcd1c9
msgid "PWM 7 and 8 in group3 (not 6C Mini)"
msgstr "PWM 7 和 8 在第 3 组（6C Mini 不含）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:69
#: e83a630ed31249018a67fa898707c905
msgid ""
"FMU outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol. If any output in a group uses DShot then all channels in that "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的 FMU 输出需使用相同的输出频率和协议。若某组内任一输出使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pixhawk6C.rst:73
#: 26458ed374ed472f988031da459709b0
msgid ""
"to use BDShot capability on outputs 1-8, use the firmware in the "
"\"Pixhawk6C-bdshot\" folder on the `Firmware Server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__"
msgstr ""
"如需在输出 1-8 上使用 BDShot 功能，请使用 `固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 上 "
"「Pixhawk6C-bdshot」 文件夹中的固件"

